ces for the current project.\n\nCurrent situation:\n- Team is working at full capacity\n- Project timeline is tight\n- Quality may be compromised without additional support\n\nRequest:\n- 2 additional developers\n- Extended deadline by 2 weeks\n- Additional budget for tools and training\n\nI'd appreciate the opportunity to discuss this further in our next meeting.\n\nBest regards,\nVince\n\n\n--- Match 4 (Relevance: 0.07669717621502264) ---\nFrom: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nTo: hr@company.com\nSubject: Vacation Request - December\nDate: 2025-10-07T08:45:00Z\nStatus: Draft\nBody:\nHi HR Team,\n\nI would like to request vacation time for the following dates:\n\nRequested Dates: December 20-31, 2025\nTotal Days: 8 working days\n\nReason: Family holiday trip\n\nI've ensured that all my current projects will be completed before my departure, and I've arranged for coverage during my absence.\n\nPlease let me know if this request is approved or if you need any additional information.\n\nThank you,\nYou\n",
